{"ticker":{"symbol":"019170.KS","name":"신풍제약","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7920.0,"change_pct":-0.013698630136986356,"market_cap":425300590592.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":6310.0,"week52_high":15680.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":656,"website":"https://shinpoong.co.kr","business_summary":"Shinpoong Pharmaceutical Co.,Ltd, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells pharmaceutical products in South Korea. The company offers cephalosporin antibiotics; penicillin antibiotics; and finished products, as well as antivirals, anticancer drugs, painkillers, anti-inflammatory products, and anthelmintics. It provides active pharmaceutical ingredients; Pyramax, an anti-malarial drug; and drugs for treating hypercholesterolemia, knee osteoarthritis and shoulder periarthritis, and surgical adhesion barrier; prescription drugs; wound dressings; health functional food; and over the counter products. In addition, the company engages in business management and exports its products to approximately 50 countries. The company was founded in 1962 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"신풍제약(주)는 자회사와 함께 한국에서 의약품을 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 세팔로스포린 항생제를 제공합니다. 페니실린 항생제; 항바이러스제, 항암제, 진통제, 항염증제, 구충제 등 완제품을 판매하고 있습니다. 활성 제약 성분을 제공합니다. 항말라리아제인 Pyramax; 및 고콜레스테롤혈증, 무릎 골관절염 및 어깨 관절 주위염 및 수술 유착 장벽을 치료하기 위한 약물; 처방약; 상처 드레싱; 건강기능식품; 그리고 카운터 제품. 또한, 당사는 경영관리에 종사하며 약 50개국에 제품을 수출하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1962년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 서울에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"제약 (스페셜티·제네릭)","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":209287627760.0,"operating_income":-34018686680.0,"net_income":-35376969310.0,"eps":-691.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":200228582500.0,"operating